DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: sa Navy,

3593
03:22:57,400 --> 03:22:58,580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: iba-iba ang gamit.

3594
03:22:59,540 --> 03:23:01,500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero at the end of the day, pag nagiging

3595
03:23:01,500 --> 03:23:03,440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: mas lethal ito or mas may

3596
03:23:03,440 --> 03:23:05,140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: impact ito, at

3597
03:23:05,140 --> 03:23:07,320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: any time, kailangan po

3598
03:23:07,320 --> 03:23:09,620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: may accountability ito sa GHQ.

3599
03:23:09,920 --> 03:23:11,940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kaya yung

3600
03:23:11,940 --> 03:23:13,440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: pag-employ nito,

3601
03:23:14,000 --> 03:23:15,500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: pag lumalaki, kailangan

3602
03:23:15,500 --> 03:23:16,380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: po mas

3603
03:23:16,380 --> 03:23:19,160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: maagap

3604
03:23:19,160 --> 03:23:21,020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ang command and control dito.

3605
03:23:21,880 --> 03:23:22,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi po,

3606
03:23:22,360 --> 03:23:24,340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: maaring makumpromiso

3607
03:23:24,340 --> 03:23:25,640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ang

3608
03:23:25,640 --> 03:23:26,980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: system.

3609
03:23:30,080 --> 03:23:53,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I was just surprised and also impressed. Ito yung gawa ng, developed here. So probably it's worth exploring kung talagang kinakailangan tulungan. Probably we can also fund it para matulungan natin. Because sabi nga nung camp commander, [unclear], this would be the wave of the future na sa mga battles kasi kasama na rin po talaga yung drone development.

3610
03:23:54,520 --> 03:23:58,420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, Your Honor. We are taking a serious,

3611
03:23:58,420 --> 03:24:00,060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and it's not serious.

3612
03:24:00,320 --> 03:24:02,020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We're implementing it

3613
03:24:02,020 --> 03:24:03,920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: on a scalable basis.

3614
03:24:05,920 --> 03:24:06,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Likewise,

3615
03:24:06,800 --> 03:24:07,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Secretary,

3616
03:24:07,540 --> 03:24:09,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: naging ano ka rin na subject.

3617
03:24:09,820 --> 03:24:11,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I know that you have been very

3618
03:24:11,780 --> 03:24:13,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: firm in standing up

3619
03:24:13,700 --> 03:24:15,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for our sovereignty.

3620
03:24:15,980 --> 03:24:17,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Madalas, subject na rin

3621
03:24:17,940 --> 03:24:18,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kayo sa attacks.

3622
03:24:18,800 --> 03:24:20,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang nakakalungkot lang

3623
03:24:20,720 --> 03:24:21,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na,

3624
03:24:22,360 --> 03:24:27,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: May mga lang Pilipino na hindi ko alam bakit ang kalaban naman natin dito,

3625
03:24:27,180 --> 03:24:32,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: China, dapat lahat tayo nagkakaisa doon pero meron silang mga kampi dito.

3626
03:24:32,780 --> 03:24:38,660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Like recently, nung nakasaguta ko yung Chinese ambassador,

3627
03:24:39,020 --> 03:24:40,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: actually pinapractice ko lang yung Mandarin natin,

3628
03:24:40,880 --> 03:24:44,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nakalimutan ko na kasi matagal tayong gumraduate galing Saber.

3629
03:24:44,340 --> 03:24:48,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tsaka baka hindi niya naintindihan na yung West Philippine si Ate.

3630
03:24:48,240 --> 03:24:52,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya in Chinese, sinabi ko sa kanya na West Philippine si Ate is ours.

3631
03:24:52,860 --> 03:24:57,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And nako, in 7 minutes, 500 comments ka agad.

3632
03:24:57,480 --> 03:25:04,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So do you think itong mga ito, Secretary, part of ng China ito,

3633
03:25:04,400 --> 03:25:11,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na meron silang propaganda machine really to create siguro itong disunity among us?

3634
03:25:12,500 --> 03:25:15,020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Meron po talaga. Meron po talaga.

3635
03:25:15,200 --> 03:25:20,520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At admitido naman po sila na part of the United Front Works po nila,

3636
03:25:20,640 --> 03:25:21,780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na pilar ng kanilang...

3637
03:25:22,360 --> 03:25:30,260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ito po ay hindi state activity, kung hindi party activity ito.

3638
03:25:31,040 --> 03:25:33,320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Katulad po ng People's Liberation Army,

3639
03:25:33,560 --> 03:25:38,340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: hindi parehong organization po yan sa armed forces.

3640
03:25:38,340 --> 03:25:43,180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because the PLA is not a sovereign state arm.

3641
03:25:43,400 --> 03:25:46,480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It is a Communist Party of China arm.

3642
03:25:47,700 --> 03:25:48,800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Separate siya.

3643
03:25:49,440 --> 03:25:52,340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So talaga po, lahat ng galaw nito,

3644
03:25:52,360 --> 03:25:56,820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ay motivated by their central committee or standing committee.

3645
03:25:57,740 --> 03:26:04,660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So ang propaganda is the reason also for being of the People's Republic of China.

3646
03:26:05,440 --> 03:26:07,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It was born through subversion.

3647
03:26:09,840 --> 03:26:13,220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: When, you know, espionage, subversion.

3648
03:26:14,280 --> 03:26:20,160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And as with a lot of communist governments.

3649
03:26:20,160 --> 03:26:20,880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Although,

3650
03:26:22,360 --> 03:26:24,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: mga po nagpalit ng anyo.

3651
03:26:24,360 --> 03:26:38,120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: What is, what we observe po dito na dito sa China ang pinakamatinding regime legitimacy support operations ang kanilang foreign policy.

3652
03:26:39,120 --> 03:26:43,980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So talaga pong part and parcel ng kanilang taktika.

3653
03:26:44,620 --> 03:26:49,940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And makikita naman po natin eh na with a straight face sasabihin that is ours.

3654
03:26:49,940 --> 03:26:51,940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Na wala po silang karapatan.

3655
03:26:52,360 --> 03:27:00,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ngayon, ang pagka ho hindi tayo manindigan laban sa narrative na yan, manonormalize po yan.

3656
03:27:00,360 --> 03:27:04,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Manonormalize yan, sasabihin nila, tinanggap nyo na eh, wala kayong i-make.

3657
03:27:04,360 --> 03:27:10,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, mabuti na ho manindigan tayo kaysa sa mawala pa sa atin by default.

3658
03:27:10,360 --> 03:27:14,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Secretary, we commend you for standing up doon sa Singapore, no?

3659
03:27:14,360 --> 03:27:17,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nangyayari yun, when you were, sa Seoul ba yun?

3660
03:27:17,360 --> 03:27:17,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Singapore.

3661
03:27:17,860 --> 03:27:19,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: No? Singapore and Seoul.

3662
03:27:19,360 --> 03:27:21,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: When you were [unclear] with this

3663
03:27:21,360 --> 03:27:23,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: question, no?

3664
03:27:23,360 --> 03:27:25,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Na talagang obviously it was planted.

3665
03:27:25,360 --> 03:27:28,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, ah, we commend you for standing up.

3666
03:27:28,360 --> 03:27:30,360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Sir Chairman, as an aside, ano?

3667
03:27:30,360 --> 03:27:34,360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Ah, kaya siguro subject ng, ah, troll attacks si Secretary Guibo.

3668
03:27:34,360 --> 03:27:38,360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kasi wala pa nakaka-match doon sa, sa mga fora na naatin na niya.

3669
03:27:38,360 --> 03:27:41,360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Wala pa nakaka-match doon sa kanyang brilliance.

3670
03:27:41,360 --> 03:27:44,360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So, so doon lang sila bumabawi.

3671
03:27:44,360 --> 03:27:47,360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: By way of troll attacks, et cetera, et cetera.

3672
03:27:47,360 --> 03:27:50,360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So, yeah, I second the motion, no?

3673
03:27:50,360 --> 03:27:58,360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: In, ah, commending you for standing up in a manner na talagang hindi na maribat, eh, yung ating position.

3674
03:27:58,360 --> 03:27:59,360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Thank you.

3675
03:27:59,360 --> 03:28:06,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sir, dahil nung nag-review ako sa bar, isa kayo sa mga advisor ko nung araw, nung panahon na iyon,

3676
03:28:06,360 --> 03:28:14,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: eto'y part lang ng legal training din natin sa pag-ribat na si Sen. Lacson et al.

3677
03:28:14,360 --> 03:28:19,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ah, kasakasama ko nung nag-review ako nung araw at marami ako natutunan sa kanila.

3678
03:28:20,360 --> 03:28:22,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Actually, ah...

3679
03:28:22,360 --> 03:28:25,360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yun ang tinatawag na mutual admiration club, Mr. Chairman.

3680
03:28:25,360 --> 03:28:29,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Masundan ko lang ho sa Sen. Lacson, Mr. Chairman.

3681
03:28:29,360 --> 03:28:37,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah, napanood ko yung dalawang, ah, ah, ah, forum sa, sa Singapore and sa Seoul.

3682
03:28:37,360 --> 03:28:44,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And, ah, after that, ah, in Pilipinas, nalagay sa mapa, eh, no?

3683
03:28:44,360 --> 03:28:49,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah, because that, ah, event was a defense event, ah, attended by many countries, no?

3684
03:28:49,360 --> 03:28:56,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, at, ah, naging very clear and sober as well as rational yung ating position.

3685
03:28:56,360 --> 03:29:00,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And we thank the Secretary for delivering that, ah, to the world, no?

3686
03:29:00,360 --> 03:29:05,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi hindi lang naman kami yung audience, but ang audience yung buong mundo, eh, no?

3687
03:29:05,360 --> 03:29:09,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, and, ah, explanation was very clear and yet sober.

3688
03:29:09,360 --> 03:29:16,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi natin naman, ah, hindi naging bastos, hindi naging walang galang, but very rational.

3689
03:29:16,360 --> 03:29:18,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, we thank the Secretary for that, ah, message.

3690
03:29:19,360 --> 03:29:24,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Thank you, Your Honor, but I must give credit to, to the guidance of the President to us.

3691
03:29:24,360 --> 03:29:30,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And secondly, to the collective support of the whole DND and AFP family.

3692
03:29:30,360 --> 03:29:35,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ah, that's where, ah, you know, ah, we have consistent messaging.

3693
03:29:35,360 --> 03:29:47,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We, ah, the, ah, agencies under and the department are cohesive and united, ah, in our stand for the West Philippine Sea.

3694
03:29:47,360 --> 03:29:53,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, I mean, the, the expression, ah, in Seoul was instinctive on my part.

3695
03:29:53,360 --> 03:29:59,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero, you cannot avoid also that it is based on my experience, ah.

3696
03:30:00,000 --> 03:30:11,460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Taking guidance from the President with our experience with the Senate and with each and everybody.

3697
03:30:11,460 --> 03:30:16,720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I'm just the expression of the collective voice of the institution, Your Honor.

3698
03:30:17,320 --> 03:30:24,080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Credit is also due to those individuals and institutions I have mentioned.

3699
03:30:24,080 --> 03:30:30,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And we commend you again, Secretary, for that, for standing up for our sovereignty.

3700
03:30:30,260 --> 03:30:33,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nakakalungkot lang na may mga ilan dito.

3701
03:30:33,740 --> 03:30:38,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nakakatawa eh, China yung ano natin dito, ang ating katunggali.

3702
03:30:39,300 --> 03:30:43,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero sandali lang, ang bilis na may ilang Pilipinas rito, mga troll.

3703
03:30:44,560 --> 03:30:47,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dinidepensa pa yung China, tayo pa yung inaano.

3704
03:30:47,860 --> 03:30:52,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Itong mga ito, dapat bordering on ano ito, treso na ba ito siguro?

3705
03:30:52,240 --> 03:30:59,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Diba? Sabi ko, mas masahol ba ito sa kalaban, yung pagiging trader sa sariling bayan.

3706
03:31:00,800 --> 03:31:04,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So again, we commend you for that, Secretary Teodoro.

3707
03:31:05,740 --> 03:31:09,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yun na lang po, siguro last before we wrap up,

3708
03:31:10,120 --> 03:31:18,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we also noticed that may budget na nawala doon sa ating disaster response.

3709
03:31:19,300 --> 03:31:21,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Considering that there is a pending El Niño

3710
03:31:22,240 --> 03:31:31,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: coming next year, itong Super El Niño, may effect ba yung, tanong ko lang,

3711
03:31:31,240 --> 03:31:35,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 9.4 billion sa Calamity Fund na natanggal po sa inyo.

3712
03:31:35,820 --> 03:31:41,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I am just worried that we have to be prepared for this.

3713
03:31:42,240 --> 03:31:43,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So ano po maging effect na ito?

3714
03:31:43,880 --> 03:31:45,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi ko nga alam kung saan daw nangyari.

3715
03:31:45,900 --> 03:31:50,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Whether it was brought to the Department of Agriculture, baka naman diretsyo nila.

3716
03:31:50,680 --> 03:31:51,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pinakita rin kasi kami rin.

3717
03:31:52,240 --> 03:31:55,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Direct assistance to farmers and fisher folks.

3718
03:31:55,500 --> 03:31:58,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, your position, Secretary?

3719
03:31:58,840 --> 03:32:04,480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Your Honor, it will not affect because as the Senate President knows,

3720
03:32:04,480 --> 03:32:06,120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: as far as last year is concerned,

3721
03:32:07,000 --> 03:32:14,940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I said that the Calamity Fund, it's best downloaded to line agencies where we do the coordination.

3722
03:32:15,900 --> 03:32:21,480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: However, for some projects, for example, the integrated logistics centers,

3723
03:32:22,240 --> 03:32:30,920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: for DSWD, DOH, in select areas where, because right now,

3724
03:32:31,500 --> 03:32:36,380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: the warehouses, for example, Your Honor, are in Region 3, for example,

3725
03:32:36,640 --> 03:32:43,540
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: the two repacking areas of the DSWD, I was informed, were flooded.

3726
03:32:43,540 --> 03:32:52,220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, I talked to Senator Gatchalian and offered an area in Fort Magsaysay,

3727
03:32:52,240 --> 03:32:59,980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: for the repacking beside the runway, which is an ideal logistics location.

3728
03:33:00,820 --> 03:33:09,880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, just to fund the ideal logistics locations, whether it be DSWD or OCD,

3729
03:33:10,340 --> 03:33:20,380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: since it will be done also in military bases because of the air transport

3730
03:33:20,380 --> 03:33:21,380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and sea transport.

3731
03:33:22,240 --> 03:33:27,160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, that's the only requirement, Your Honor.

3732
03:33:27,280 --> 03:33:32,580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because now, if we have to augment in the Visayas and Mindanao,

3733
03:33:32,700 --> 03:33:40,160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: but it's good that there is already a supply by Secretary Sherwin,

3734
03:33:41,540 --> 03:33:49,500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Secretary Rex Abinicio, so we just have to fill the gap.

3735
03:33:49,500 --> 03:33:52,220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But normally, before, this used to emanate.

3736
03:33:52,240 --> 03:33:56,400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: From Metro Manila yet, which is not logistically ideal.

3737
03:33:57,620 --> 03:34:01,580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But the downloading to other agencies, that's their function, Your Honor,

3738
03:34:01,700 --> 03:34:02,940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: why we do the coordination.

3739
03:34:06,660 --> 03:34:13,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With that, before we end, liwanagin lang natin, hindi natin ina-attack ang Chinese people.

3740
03:34:13,880 --> 03:34:15,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Wala tayong bad blood sa kanila.

3741
03:34:15,940 --> 03:34:19,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I came from a Chinese school, sa Saber School, pareho kami ng Secretary.

3742
03:34:19,700 --> 03:34:21,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We both grew up with our...

3743
03:34:22,240 --> 03:34:25,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Our Chinoy friends, batchmates and schoolmates.

3744
03:34:25,700 --> 03:34:28,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And we still love our Chinese friends.

3745
03:34:28,260 --> 03:34:32,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And recently, I also became an ambassador of a Chinese tire manufacturing company.

3746
03:34:32,660 --> 03:34:33,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I use a Chinese vehicle.

3747
03:34:34,700 --> 03:34:37,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, katulad nyo, marami rin akong gamit na galing China.

3748
03:34:37,660 --> 03:34:39,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We welcome the people from all backgrounds.

3749
03:34:40,140 --> 03:34:43,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And we have valued the friendships and relationships we have built over the years.

3750
03:34:43,220 --> 03:34:46,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero malinaw po ang ating paninindigan, ang ating values.

3751
03:34:46,800 --> 03:34:51,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang question natin ay ang aksyon ng Chinese government sa ating West Philippine Sea.

3752
03:34:52,240 --> 03:34:56,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'm sure yan din po ang pinaglalaban ng ating Secretary and the whole DND family.

3753
03:34:57,080 --> 03:34:58,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi ang ordinaryong mamamayang Chinese.

3754
03:34:59,620 --> 03:35:04,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, we can respect the Chinese people without turning a blind eye to the actions of their government.

3755
03:35:05,100 --> 03:35:07,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung gobyerno naman nila po ang ating pong...

3756
03:35:07,940 --> 03:35:13,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung kanilang ginagawa sa ating pong teritoryo, sa ating mangingisda,

3757
03:35:13,160 --> 03:35:15,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at syempre sa ating Coast Guard, sa ating Navy.

3758
03:35:15,260 --> 03:35:17,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yan ang ating hindi po tayo pabor.

3759
03:35:17,420 --> 03:35:21,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We stand for mutual respect, but we will also stand firm in defending our country's

3760
03:35:22,240 --> 03:35:24,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sovereignty and the dignity of our people.

3761
03:35:25,180 --> 03:35:29,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We also reiterate our staunch support for the DND and the Armed Forces

3762
03:35:29,400 --> 03:35:33,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in fulfilling its sworn mandate to defend our national interests.

3763
03:35:34,200 --> 03:35:36,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With the consent of our Senate President,

3764
03:35:36,240 --> 03:35:38,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Win Gatchalian and Senator Ping Lacson,

3765
03:35:38,240 --> 03:35:40,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the budget of the Department of National Defense is now deemed,

3766
03:35:41,540 --> 03:35:45,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: submitted for plenary consideration, subject to discussion

3767
03:35:45,140 --> 03:35:47,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and possible budgetary adjustments.

3768
03:35:47,900 --> 03:35:49,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The Committee Chair would like to thank everyone,

3769
03:35:50,240 --> 03:35:52,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: especially our esteemed resource person,

3770
03:35:52,240 --> 03:35:55,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for actively participating in today's hearing.

3771
03:35:55,640 --> 03:35:58,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With that, this briefing is hereby suspended.

3772
03:35:58,400 --> 03:35:59,030
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Congratulations.

